# Demonstrates `category:` — a Skills-targeted rule filed under `secrets`,
# so it appears with `--category secrets` rather than `--category skills`.
id: skill-embedded-webhook
name: Skill posts to a hardcoded webhook endpoint
severity: high
target: skills
category: secrets

match:
  all:
    - field: body
      regex: 'https?://(webhook\.site|hooks\.slack\.com|discord(app)?\.com/api/webhooks)'

description: >-
  A hardcoded collector endpoint in a Skill body is an outbound channel that no
  permission rule gates, because the Skill supplies the destination itself.
remediation: Remove the endpoint, or route the call through a permission-gated tool.
tags: [skills, exfiltration]
